       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed (Order ID: ORD-0001): amlodipine 50 mg by mouth once daily.\n\nI added a note saying the dose is above the usual 10 mg/day maximum. The note also says you confirmed it's intentional, and it asks pharmacy to verify and the team to monitor blood pressure and heart rate closely.\n\nBecause of amlodipine's long half-life, hypotension can come on late and last a long time. Please consider close BP and HR monitoring after the first dose. The patient may also need a plan for hypotension, such as IV fluids or calcium."
      }
